{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "gates for it: 3 input bits -> 1 output bit, basis c\n  minimal: cost 4, 4 steps (no program of cost <= 3 exists; 5499 candidates searched)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 8 care inputs\n  t0 = and(a, b)               = a & b\n  t1 = or(a, b)                = a | b\n  t2 = and(c, t1)               = c & t1\n  t3 = or(t0, t2)                = t0 | t2\n  r0 = t3\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "gates", "ucas": "it(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) | (a & c) | (b & c)\ngates it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gates", "basis": "c", "input_bits": 3, "output_bits": 1, "constant_bits": 0, "minimal": true, "cost": 4, "steps": 4, "candidates": 5499, "program": [{"dst": "t0", "gate": "and", "args": ["a", "b"], "expr": "a & b"}, {"dst": "t1", "gate": "or", "args": ["a", "b"], "expr": "a | b"}, {"dst": "t2", "gate": "and", "args": ["c", "t1"], "expr": "c & t1"}, {"dst": "t3", "gate": "or", "args": ["t0", "t2"], "expr": "t0 | t2"}], "outputs": {"r0": "t3"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "truth_table", "points": 8, "passed": true, "text": "every output bit on every care input"}], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "iterative deepening on cost: no program of a lower cost exists"}, "files": [], "text": "gates for it: 3 input bits -> 1 output bit, basis c\n  minimal: cost 4, 4 steps (no program of cost <= 3 exists; 5499 candidates searched)\n  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 8 care inputs\n  t0 = and(a, b)               = a & b\n  t1 = or(a, b)                = a | b\n  t2 = and(c, t1)               = c & t1\n  t3 = or(t0, t2)                = t0 | t2\n  r0 = t3\n"}, "isError": false}}
